{"indicator":"main","unit":"","years":[2010,2020],"notes":{"TWN":"Pew 把台灣的民間信仰與道教歸在「其他宗教」（2020 年約 52%），佛教徒約 19%、無宗教信仰約 23%、基督徒約 6%。很多人同時拜佛、拜神、祭祖，用單一宗教分類只是近似。內政部宗教統計：2025 年底登記的寺廟 12,397 座（道教 9,824、佛教 2,277、一貫道 243），教會（堂）2,855 座（基督教 2,373、天主教 429）；民間信仰多半沒有登記入教，內政部沒有各宗教的信徒比例。"},"notesEn":{"TWN":"Pew counts Taiwan's folk religion and Taoism as \"other religions\" (about 52% in 2020); about 19% are Buddhist, 23% unaffiliated and 6% Christian. Many people worship at Buddhist and folk temples and venerate ancestors at the same time, so a single religion is only an approximation. Ministry of the Interior religious statistics: at the end of 2025 there were 12,397 registered temples (Taoist 9,824, Buddhist 2,277, Yiguandao 243) and 2,855 churches (Protestant 2,373, Catholic 429); most folk-religion believers are not registered, so the ministry has no figures on the share of believers."},"encoding":"delta","values":{"AFG":[0,2,0],"ALB":[0,2,0],"DZA":[0,2,0],"AGO":[0,1,0],"ARG":[0,1,0],"ARM":[0,1,0],"ABW":[0,1,0],"AUS":[0,1,0],"AUT":[0,1,0],"AZE":[0,2,0],"BHS":[0,1,0],"BHR":[0,2,0],"BGD":[0,2,0],"BRB":[0,1,0],"BLR":[0,1,0],"BEL":[0,1,0],"BLZ":[0,1,0],"BEN":[0,1,0],"BTN":[0,5,0],"BOL":[0,1,0],"BIH":[0,2,0],"BWA":[0,1,0],"BRA":[0,1,0],"BRN":[0,2,0],"BGR":[0,1,0],"BFA":[0,2,0],"BDI":[0,1,0],"KHM":[0,5,0],"CMR":[0,1,0],"CAN":[0,1,0],"CPV":[0,1,0],"CAF":[0,1,0],"TCD":[0,2,0],"CHL":[0,1,0],"CHN":[0,3,0],"COL":[0,1,0],"COM":[0,2,0],"CRI":[0,1,0],"HRV":[0,1,0],"CUB":[0,1,0],"CUW":[0,1,0],"CYP":[0,1,0],"CZE":[0,3,0],"COD":[0,1,0],"DNK":[0,1,0],"DJI":[0,2,0],"DOM":[0,1,0],"ECU":[0,1,0],"EGY":[0,2,0],"SLV":[0,1,0],"GNQ":[0,1,0],"ERI":[0,2,0],"EST":[0,1,0],"SWZ":[0,1,0],"ETH":[0,1,0],"FSM":[0,1,0],"FJI":[0,1,0],"FIN":[0,1,0],"FRA":[0,1,0],"GUF":[0,1,0],"PYF":[0,1,0],"GAB":[0,1,0],"GMB":[0,2,0],"GEO":[0,1,0],"DEU":[0,1,0],"GHA":[0,1,0],"GRC":[0,1,0],"GRD":[0,1,0],"GLP":[0,1,0],"GUM":[0,1,0],"GTM":[0,1,0],"GIN":[0,2,0],"GNB":[0,2,0],"GUY":[0,1,0],"HTI":[0,1,0],"HND":[0,1,0],"HKG":[0,3,0],"HU